OL,3,APupil arrested after two teachers shot
OL,4,Aat French school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fprincipal and teacher were shot at a
OL,8,Fschool in southern France on Monday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FThe 14-year-old entered Lakanal middle
OL,12,Fschool "with a shotgun inside a guitar
OL,13,Fcase" and opened fire before being
OL,14,Frestrained by a member of staff,
OL,15,Fregional officials told French media.
OL,17,FNo children were harmed and the
OL,18,Fteachers have been treated for injuries
OL,19,Fwhich are not life-threatening,
OL,20,Faccording to Aubagne Mayor Jean-Pierre
OL,21,FSquillari, who said the suspect had
OL,22,Fbeen in the ninth grade.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
