OL,3,APupil arrested after two teachers shot
OL,4,Aat French school
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal media reported that the incident
OL,7,Fwas not thought to be related to
OL,8,Fongoing protests over school
OL,9,Fconditions, citing sources familiar
OL,10,Fwith the investigation.
